  <p id="c-wenxuan-058-huiduan-aice:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">惟永泰元年。秋九月朔日，<persName id="c-wenxuan-058-huiduan-aice:p002:m0012" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">敬皇后</persName>梓宮啟自先塋，將祔于某陵。</p>
